  "collectionNotes": [
    "原始官方出厂程序已运行至 Onboard 页面；约 8 秒后的输入无画面响应，最后串口标记为 BLE Test，阻塞原因尚未完成定位。",
    "原生测试已验证早期滑动与相同时刻无输入对照存在差异；后续触摸响应尚未通过。",
    "原厂程序已通过原生和公开 Worker／WASM 的 SDMMC 单线挂载默认 64 MiB FAT32；原生记录 33 个命令、1744 字节读取、0 重启及 2 次初始化超时。",
    "原厂日志仍有 I2C 写入失败，保留未支持／保留位的 NACK；QMI 数字轴已接入，物理安装朝向未标定。",
    "独立 3D 模型已接入；真实 IMU 板坐标与实物朝向标定仍未完成；无线、USB、模拟电池和全部外设未验收。",
    "Grounded QMI SA0 selects 0x6B according to primary QST documentation; old opposite-address inference is withdrawn.",
    "CST820 identity values are unknown zero in the digital subset, not borrowed from a CST816S.",
    "Factory console retains I2C write failures. Reserved-bit writes in public driver are not enough to attribute every binary failure without a byte trace.",
    "本次原生执行记录位于 docs/evidence/waveshare-tca-rgb-2026-11-23；运行结果不等于浏览器/WebGL 或实物验收。",
    "原文位于 docs/research/waveshare-tca-rgb-sources 与 waveshare-tca-rgb-central-sources；源码 ZIP 成员与原始 HTTP 文档分别记账。",
    "新 public Worker/WASM 结果在 docs/evidence/waveshare-tca-rgb-public-2026-11-23。真实早期触摸投递已观察；此轮像素差包含时间变化，因果对照仍以独立 native matched-time 为准。",
    "IMU 数字输入：QMI8658 寄存器转换和八款板级 I2C 已验证；场景联动默认关闭，物理安装方向未标定。",
    "TF 修复依据与前后证据：docs/evidence/waveshare-tca-sdmmc-2026-11-23/manifest.json",
    "修复后的公开运行证据：docs/evidence/waveshare-tca-rgb-public-sdmmc-2026-11-23/results.json；之前挂载失败记录仍保留。",
    "3D 来源：官方 CAD 机械参考。 生产加载器几何与输入射线已检查；浏览器 WebGL 和实物装配尚未验收。",
    "Separate exact flat and curved manufacturer CAD files are used; all native solids/free shells/faces and original millimetre transforms remain intact.",
    "Curved cover geometry comes from the actual2.1B STEP. Its flat framebuffer projection is an explicitly uncalibrated optical approximation, not curved lens refraction or per-pixel surface calibration.",
    "No inferred external case, antenna behaviour, battery chemistry, power-switch electronics or connector mating calibration. Uncolored native components remain neutral grey. Photographic PCB comparison is a visible mechanical reference, not proof of every electrical revision."
  ]
}
